meta {
  name: Proxy Image
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/images/proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.igdb.com%2Figdb%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Ft_cover_big%2Fco3ofx.jpg
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  url: https%3A%2F%2Fimages.igdb.com%2Figdb%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Ft_cover_big%2Fco3ofx.jpg
}

docs {
  Proxies a game cover/screenshot image server-side, since some origins
  block direct hotlinking. Public, unauthenticated. Only
  images.igdb.com, howlongtobeat.com, media.steampowered.com,
  steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net, and *.steamstatic.com/*.steamgriddb.com are
  allowed (https only); anything else returns 400.

  400 if the content-type isn't a supported raster image format or the
  body exceeds 10MB, 404 if the upstream request fails or returns an
  error status. Response is cached for 24h (Cache-Control: public,
  max-age=86400, immutable).
}
